#: ../../content/ehealth/vacances-collectives.md:1
msgid "Collective holidays"
msgstr "Vacances collectives"

#: ../../content/ehealth/vacances-collectives.md:4
msgid ""
"Organise a group trip in Resthome: register the residents taking part, watch"
" the 14-day yearly quota and notify each health insurance fund before "
"departure."
msgstr ""
"Organiser un séjour de groupe dans Resthome : inscrire les habitants "
"participants, surveiller le quota annuel de 14 jours et prévenir chaque "
"mutuelle avant le départ."

#: ../../content/ehealth/vacances-collectives.md:8
msgid "How do I record a group trip in Resthome?"
msgstr "Comment enregistrer un séjour de groupe dans Resthome ?"

#: ../../content/ehealth/vacances-collectives.md:9
msgid ""
"Create a collective holiday: give it a name, the departure and return dates,"
" the destination, and the residents taking part. Resthome counts the days "
"and prepares one notification per resident."
msgstr ""
"Créez une vacance collective : donnez-lui un nom, les dates de départ et de "
"retour, la destination et les habitants participants. Resthome compte les "
"jours et prépare une notification par habitant."

#: ../../content/ehealth/vacances-collectives.md:11
msgid ""
"How many days of collective holiday is a resident entitled to per year?"
msgstr ""
"À combien de jours de vacances collectives un habitant a-t-il droit par an ?"

#: ../../content/ehealth/vacances-collectives.md:12
msgid ""
"Fourteen days per calendar year. Resthome shows, for each resident selected,"
" the days already taken this year plus this trip, and highlights in red "
"anyone who would go over."
msgstr ""
"Quatorze jours par année civile. Resthome affiche, pour chaque habitant "
"sélectionné, les jours déjà pris cette année plus ce séjour, et met en rouge"
" ceux qui dépasseraient."

#: ../../content/ehealth/vacances-collectives.md:14
msgid "When must the health insurance funds be notified?"
msgstr "Quand faut-il prévenir les mutuelles ?"

#: ../../content/ehealth/vacances-collectives.md:15
msgid ""
"At least two weeks before departure. Resthome warns you if the lead time is "
"shorter, but does not block the send — a shorter notice may be justified."
msgstr ""
"Au moins deux semaines avant le départ. Resthome vous avertit si le délai "
"est plus court, mais ne bloque pas l'envoi — un préavis plus court peut être"
" justifié."

#: ../../content/ehealth/vacances-collectives.md:17
msgid "Does each resident get their own notification?"
msgstr "Chaque habitant reçoit-il sa propre notification ?"

#: ../../content/ehealth/vacances-collectives.md:18
msgid ""
"Yes. Each resident taking part receives a separate Annexe 7 notification to "
"their own health insurance fund."
msgstr ""
"Oui. Chaque habitant participant reçoit une notification Annexe 7 distincte,"
" vers sa propre mutuelle."

#: ../../content/ehealth/vacances-collectives.md:20
msgid "Can I cancel a collective holiday?"
msgstr "Puis-je annuler une vacance collective ?"

#: ../../content/ehealth/vacances-collectives.md:21
msgid ""
"Yes, as long as it is not marked Done. A cancelled trip can be reset to "
"draft if the plan comes back on."
msgstr ""
"Oui, tant qu'elle n'est pas marquée Terminée. Un séjour annulé peut être "
"remis en brouillon si le projet redémarre."

#: ../../content/ehealth/vacances-collectives.md:24
msgid ""
"A **collective holiday** is a group trip: the seaside, the mountains, a few "
"days away. It has consequences for billing and for the health insurance "
"funds, which must be told. Resthome handles the whole thing from one record."
msgstr ""
"Une **vacance collective** est un séjour de groupe : la mer, la montagne, "
"quelques jours ailleurs. Elle a des conséquences sur la facturation et pour "
"les mutuelles, qui doivent en être informées. Resthome gère l'ensemble "
"depuis une seule fiche."

#: ../../content/ehealth/vacances-collectives.md:28
msgid "Menu: **eHealth → Collective holidays**."
msgstr "Menu : **eHealth → Vacances collectives**."

#: ../../content/ehealth/vacances-collectives.md:30
msgid "1. Create the trip"
msgstr "1\\. Créer le séjour"

#: ../../content/ehealth/vacances-collectives.md:32
msgid ""
"Give the trip a **name** — something recognisable, such as the destination "
"and the year."
msgstr ""
"Donnez au séjour un **nom** — quelque chose de reconnaissable, comme la "
"destination et l'année."

#: ../../content/ehealth/vacances-collectives.md:34
msgid ""
"Enter the **departure** and **return** dates. Resthome counts the days, "
"**both dates included**."
msgstr ""
"Saisissez les dates de **départ** et de **retour**. Resthome compte les "
"jours, **les deux dates incluses**."

#: ../../content/ehealth/vacances-collectives.md:36
msgid "Note the **destination** in free text."
msgstr "Notez la **destination** en texte libre."

#: ../../content/ehealth/vacances-collectives.md:37
msgid "Add the **residents** taking part."
msgstr "Ajoutez les **habitants** participants."

#: ../../content/ehealth/vacances-collectives.md:39
msgid "The return cannot precede the departure"
msgstr "Le retour ne peut précéder le départ"

#: ../../content/ehealth/vacances-collectives.md:42
msgid ""
"Resthome refuses a return date earlier than the departure date — a simple "
"guard against a slip that would otherwise distort every day count."
msgstr ""
"Resthome refuse une date de retour antérieure à la date de départ — un "
"garde-fou simple contre une erreur qui fausserait tout le décompte."

#: ../../content/ehealth/vacances-collectives.md:46
msgid "2. Watch the quota"
msgstr "2\\. Surveiller le quota"

#: ../../content/ehealth/vacances-collectives.md:48
msgid ""
"Each resident is entitled to **14 days of collective holiday per calendar "
"year**. As soon as you add residents, Resthome shows, for each of them:"
msgstr ""
"Chaque habitant a droit à **14 jours de vacances collectives par année "
"civile**. Dès que vous ajoutez des habitants, Resthome affiche, pour chacun "
":"

#: ../../content/ehealth/vacances-collectives.md:51
msgid "the days **already taken** this year, across the other trips;"
msgstr "les jours **déjà pris** cette année, tous séjours confondus ;"

#: ../../content/ehealth/vacances-collectives.md:52
msgid "the days of **this trip**;"
msgstr "les jours de **ce séjour** ;"

#: ../../content/ehealth/vacances-collectives.md:53
msgid "the **total**, highlighted in red if it goes beyond 14."
msgstr "le **total**, mis en rouge s'il dépasse 14."

#: ../../content/ehealth/vacances-collectives.md:55
msgid "A warning, not a block"
msgstr "Un avertissement, pas un blocage"

#: ../../content/ehealth/vacances-collectives.md:58
msgid ""
"Resthome flags the overrun but lets you proceed: the decision belongs to the"
" facility, which may have grounds for it. What matters is that nobody "
"discovers the overrun after the fact."
msgstr ""
"Resthome signale le dépassement mais vous laisse continuer : la décision "
"appartient à l'établissement, qui peut avoir ses raisons. L'essentiel est "
"que personne ne découvre le dépassement après coup."

#: ../../content/ehealth/vacances-collectives.md:63
msgid "3. Notify the health insurance funds"
msgstr "3\\. Prévenir les mutuelles"

#: ../../content/ehealth/vacances-collectives.md:65
msgid ""
"Click **Communicate to OAs**. Each participating resident receives a "
"separate **Annexe 7** notification, addressed to their own health insurance "
"fund."
msgstr ""
"Cliquez sur **Communiquer aux OA**. Chaque habitant participant reçoit une "
"notification **Annexe 7** distincte, adressée à sa propre mutuelle."

#: ../../content/ehealth/vacances-collectives.md:68
msgid "Two weeks' notice"
msgstr "Un préavis de deux semaines"

#: ../../content/ehealth/vacances-collectives.md:71
msgid ""
"The funds must be notified **at least two weeks before departure**. If you "
"send with a shorter lead time, Resthome records a warning in the record's "
"log but does not block the send — a late departure may be justified, and the"
" trace is what matters."
msgstr ""
"Les mutuelles doivent être prévenues **au moins deux semaines avant le "
"départ**. Si vous envoyez avec un délai plus court, Resthome consigne un "
"avertissement dans le journal de la fiche mais ne bloque pas l'envoi — un "
"départ tardif peut être justifié, et c'est la trace qui compte."

#: ../../content/ehealth/vacances-collectives.md:77
msgid "Statuses"
msgstr "États"

#: ../../content/ehealth/vacances-collectives.md:68
msgid "Status"
msgstr "État"

#: ../../content/ehealth/vacances-collectives.md:68
msgid "Meaning"
msgstr "Signification"

#: ../../content/ehealth/vacances-collectives.md:68
msgid "**Draft**"
msgstr "**Brouillon**"

#: ../../content/ehealth/vacances-collectives.md:68
msgid "Being prepared; nothing has been sent."
msgstr "En préparation ; rien n'a été envoyé."

#: ../../content/ehealth/vacances-collectives.md:68
msgid "**Communicated to OAs**"
msgstr "**Communiquée aux OA**"

#: ../../content/ehealth/vacances-collectives.md:68
msgid "The notifications have gone out."
msgstr "Les notifications sont parties."

#: ../../content/ehealth/vacances-collectives.md:68
msgid "**Done**"
msgstr "**Terminée**"

#: ../../content/ehealth/vacances-collectives.md:68
msgid "The trip has taken place."
msgstr "Le séjour a eu lieu."

#: ../../content/ehealth/vacances-collectives.md:68
msgid "**Cancelled**"
msgstr "**Annulée**"

#: ../../content/ehealth/vacances-collectives.md:68
msgid "Called off; can be reset to draft."
msgstr "Annulé ; peut être remis en brouillon."

#: ../../content/ehealth/vacances-collectives.md:86
msgid "Key takeaways"
msgstr "Points clés à retenir"

#: ../../content/ehealth/vacances-collectives.md:88
msgid ""
"One record covers the whole trip: **dates, destination, participants**."
msgstr ""
"Une seule fiche couvre tout le séjour : **dates, destination, "
"participants**."

#: ../../content/ehealth/vacances-collectives.md:89
msgid ""
"The **14 days per year** quota is checked per resident, with the year's "
"running total."
msgstr ""
"Le quota de **14 jours par an** est vérifié par habitant, avec le cumul de "
"l'année."

#: ../../content/ehealth/vacances-collectives.md:91
msgid ""
"**Communicate to OAs** produces one **Annexe 7** per resident, to their own "
"fund."
msgstr ""
"**Communiquer aux OA** produit une **Annexe 7** par habitant, vers sa propre"
" mutuelle."

#: ../../content/ehealth/vacances-collectives.md:93
msgid "Notify **two weeks ahead**; a shorter notice warns without blocking."
msgstr ""
"Prévenez **deux semaines à l'avance** ; un préavis plus court avertit sans "
"bloquer."

